OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters spend second night at
OL,4,Ascene of Glasgow scrapyard blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine fire engines, two high-reach
OL,7,Fvehicles and specialist resources
OL,8,Fresponded to the incident. No
OL,9,Fcasualties were reported.
